Theorem (T-dense(C), C < C_7 := (2/r)(1 + √(1 − ρ*))², ρ* = the doubly-positive constant of P17).
- There is c(C) > 0 with M(A) >= c(C)√|A| for every nonempty finite A ⊂ Z_{>0} with max A <= C|A|.
